section.clients-testimonials.section-padding
  .container
    h2.section-title CLIENTS & KIND WORDS
    p.section-desc Some of the teams that trusted us with their brands.
    .clients-grid
      each client in clients
        img(src=`images/logo-${client}.webp` width="120" height="40" alt=`${client} logo` loading="lazy")
    .testimonial-card
      .quote-icon “
      p.testimonial-text Keepsake turned a vague brief into a brand we are proud of. The team was fast, honest about trade-offs and obsessed with the details.
      .author-block
        .author-avatar OM
        .author-info
          strong OLENA MARCHENKO
          span Marketing Lead, Nordly
        .slider-dots
          span.dot.active
          span.dot
          span.dot
